WEBVTT

00:03.962 --> 00:05.171
Suzukiri.

00:06.006 --> 00:09.843
The Pink and Green Squadron will be
going to badmouth the Red Keeper…

00:09.926 --> 00:12.178
No, I mean, we're planning to have
an after-party together.

00:12.846 --> 00:14.180
Would you like to join us?

00:14.764 --> 00:18.685
If you'd like, young Sakurama,
who's always with you, may join us too.

00:20.520 --> 00:25.692
Oh, I'm sorry. I'll be busy catching up on
the TV drama I've recorded, so I'll pass.

00:25.775 --> 00:27.193
That is unfortunate.

00:29.529 --> 00:32.949
Not like you cared
about my attendance in the first place.

00:33.033 --> 00:35.702
You just want Sakurama, right?
How troublesome.

00:35.785 --> 00:37.203
Why don't you just say it outright?

00:37.287 --> 00:38.455
What could you mean?

00:38.538 --> 00:43.460
If you want to climb to a higher position,
it'll do you better to be more amiable.

00:45.795 --> 00:47.047
Got it!

00:48.882 --> 00:51.718
Man… This is boring.

00:58.433 --> 01:01.102
<i>Good luck, D.</i>

01:03.396 --> 01:05.398
<i>I'm counting on you to take my place.</i>

01:08.068 --> 01:09.903
<i>Hibiki Sakurama.</i>

01:09.986 --> 01:12.989
<i>Don't go dying on your own
and get me into trouble.</i>

01:13.907 --> 01:16.618
<i>The power of bonds, huh…</i>

01:22.749 --> 01:24.417
Go! Go! Loser Ranger!

02:50.378 --> 02:54.966
Episode 5
Fighter D, as a Part of "Ranger Force"

02:55.049 --> 02:57.385
<i>The choice I've once abandoned…</i>

02:57.468 --> 02:59.846
<i>This life that I once nearly lost…</i>

02:59.929 --> 03:01.472
<i>What can I do?</i>

03:02.056 --> 03:03.683
<i>Who should I defeat?</i>

03:15.820 --> 03:17.864
<i>I wasn't able to do anything until morning</i>

03:17.947 --> 03:19.824
<i>and ended up coming back
to Sakurama's room.</i>

03:20.366 --> 03:23.077
<i>This room's kinda noisy.</i>

03:27.165 --> 03:29.250
My disguise's perfect.

03:29.334 --> 03:31.586
It still hurts.

03:31.669 --> 03:34.047
Do I look slightly thinner than before?

03:37.592 --> 03:40.637
I guess that really took
a little out of me.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.056
<i>Ever since he saved me,</i>

03:43.139 --> 03:45.892
<i>I've been having
this weird feeling inside me.</i>

03:47.769 --> 03:50.396
D, I have a request.

03:50.480 --> 03:51.731
What?

03:51.814 --> 03:53.524
Just as I just told you,

03:53.608 --> 03:55.652
my older sister and I
were attacked by a monster,

03:55.735 --> 03:58.696
and we were supposed to die
with our parents.

04:00.740 --> 04:02.450
Hibiki! Are you okay?

04:02.533 --> 04:03.826
Y-Yeah…

04:03.910 --> 04:06.329
I'm sorry that I caused you pain.

04:18.174 --> 04:21.594
<i>Blue Keeper was the one who saved us.</i>

04:22.178 --> 04:25.098
<i>After he retired,
he raised us just like any parent would.</i>

04:25.181 --> 04:27.058
<i>He's a real hero.</i>

04:27.934 --> 04:32.063
I looked up to him,
and so I joined the Rangers.

04:32.355 --> 04:36.859
However, it turned out to be
a disappointing acting troupe, huh?

04:36.943 --> 04:39.153
My condolences.

04:39.237 --> 04:41.781
I wanted to expose
the truth behind the war

04:41.864 --> 04:43.783
through the power of mass media.

04:43.866 --> 04:45.159
However…

04:47.954 --> 04:50.123
<i>As I waited for the news agency
at the agreed-upon place,</i>

04:50.206 --> 04:52.375
<i>I was attacked by unknown assailants.</i>

04:55.628 --> 04:58.298
<i>I don't know
how deeply rooted this darkness is.</i>

04:59.841 --> 05:03.136
If I continue to pry deeper,
it'll cause trouble for my older sister.

05:04.345 --> 05:08.558
Still, I'm prepared to abandon everything
in order to achieve my goal.

05:09.267 --> 05:13.271
In the meantime,
I hope you can take my place, D.

05:14.981 --> 05:17.025
No need to ramble on
and beat about the bush.

05:17.108 --> 05:18.901
In short,

05:18.985 --> 05:21.195
you just want to end the war, right?

05:21.279 --> 05:24.032
Then just defeat all your enemies,
it's as simple as that.

05:26.200 --> 05:31.539
Dusters, why is it
that we are living such constrained lives?

05:31.622 --> 05:35.293
Why don't we laugh as we wish,
and cry as we wish?

05:35.376 --> 05:38.546
Let us take back this planet,
and live freely!

05:39.839 --> 05:42.842
That's the only way I know.

05:46.179 --> 05:49.849
You… Once you defeat the Rangers
and become free,

05:49.932 --> 05:51.267
what do you want to do?

05:51.893 --> 05:54.312
Do you even need to ask?

05:54.395 --> 05:55.438
I…

05:55.980 --> 05:57.106
I…

05:59.901 --> 06:01.944
<i>I don't care about that.</i>

06:02.028 --> 06:04.447
<i>For now, I just have to focus
on defeating the Dragon Keepers</i>

06:04.530 --> 06:07.033
<i>and crushing the Rangers.</i>

06:10.745 --> 06:13.790
This thing's been going off
the entire time… Huh?

06:14.665 --> 06:15.750
The hell is this?

06:15.833 --> 06:16.876
Huh?

06:16.959 --> 06:18.503
Whoa! Uh…

06:21.381 --> 06:24.842
Sooner or later,
you'll have to meet my fellow trainees.

06:24.926 --> 06:26.803
They're all nice people.

06:27.387 --> 06:29.806
I've written down information
on my personal relationships

06:29.889 --> 06:32.433
at the device in my room.

06:32.517 --> 06:34.185
Please read through it carefully.

06:34.894 --> 06:36.354
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

06:36.896 --> 06:39.315
Nope. No way.
This isn't gonna work.

06:39.399 --> 06:40.817
Could you do something about this?

06:40.900 --> 06:43.319
I'm begging you!

06:43.403 --> 06:46.322
Well… I guess
I could at least try something.

06:46.406 --> 06:50.201
In the first place,
I'm posted here as a maintenance officer,

06:50.284 --> 06:52.328
so this is out of my expertise.

06:52.412 --> 06:54.580
Oh, and one more thing.

06:54.664 --> 06:58.835
The noise inside my room is terrible,
so could you take a look at it?

06:58.918 --> 07:01.546
The walls
aren't supposed to be thin though.

07:01.629 --> 07:04.882
I understand.
I'll go look at your room later.

07:04.966 --> 07:08.344
In return, could you do me a favor?

07:09.178 --> 07:12.515
These. Please give them out
to the other Independent Rangers.

07:15.435 --> 07:18.062
He's pretty understanding for a Ranger.

07:18.146 --> 07:22.108
I like him. I'll defeat him last.

07:22.191 --> 07:23.276
Oh, Hibiki!

07:23.359 --> 07:25.111
Good work today.

07:25.194 --> 07:26.195
Y-Yeah…

07:26.279 --> 07:28.698
<i>He seems like
one of Sakurama's contemporaries…</i>

07:28.781 --> 07:30.408
Good work today, Yamato.

07:30.491 --> 07:32.869
I just happen to have something for you.

07:33.995 --> 07:36.164
Thanks. Sorry for the trouble!

07:37.498 --> 07:39.125
By the way, Yamato.

07:39.250 --> 07:41.294
I wanna go outside.

07:41.377 --> 07:42.628
Everyone wants to.

07:43.129 --> 07:47.258
But once the training period begins,
we're not allowed to leave.

07:47.341 --> 07:49.677
So it's back
to our usual underground life today.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.179
Wait, underground?

07:52.680 --> 07:56.642
What's this…
"The White Dragon's Nest"?

07:56.726 --> 07:58.853
This is where I'm currently living in?

07:58.936 --> 08:02.148
Hey, I wanna meet the Dragon Keepers…

08:02.231 --> 08:06.444
I feel you. But as you know,
we're Independent Rangers.

08:06.527 --> 08:08.112
<i>Our only choice is to win our fights,</i>

08:08.196 --> 08:09.530
<i>be the last ones standing, and be chosen.</i>

08:09.614 --> 08:11.032
<i>By one of the five squads, that is.</i>

08:11.115 --> 08:15.578
<i>Sakurama… You bastard,
you should've gotten a better rank!</i>

08:16.078 --> 08:19.373
I'm the same too, you know?
At first, I thought I'd become a Ranger…

08:19.457 --> 08:22.335
No, I thought I'd be able to become
a Dragon Keeper in no time.

08:23.586 --> 08:24.837
And then…

08:25.254 --> 08:29.842
I'd make the Ranger girls fawn over me!
That's the dream of all humanity!

08:29.926 --> 08:34.305
But that accursed Sousei Akabane…
They chose him over me!

08:36.432 --> 08:37.725
<i>This is dumb.</i>

08:37.808 --> 08:40.520
<i>Oh well, I guess all cadets are like this.</i>

08:40.603 --> 08:42.980
Everyone should be at the canteen
at this time.

08:43.564 --> 08:44.899
Wanna come along?

08:45.483 --> 08:48.152
What? I'm eating right now.

08:50.488 --> 08:51.864
I'll leave this here.

08:51.948 --> 08:57.620
Hey. Isn't this photo badly taken?
I don't look good at all.

08:58.996 --> 09:02.625
Why are you guys here?
I feel more at ease alone!

09:04.502 --> 09:07.672
Seems like I'm not the only one she hates.

09:07.755 --> 09:10.675
I want to get along
since we're all fellow colleagues,

09:10.758 --> 09:13.844
but I guess it can't be helped
since we're all competitors now.

09:15.513 --> 09:18.099
But isn't it funny?

09:18.182 --> 09:19.684
Despite everything you said,

09:19.767 --> 09:22.436
you're the first one
to defeat a monster, Sakurama.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.188
"Everything I said"?

09:24.272 --> 09:27.191
Huh? Don't tell me you don't remember?

09:27.275 --> 09:28.818
Oh, that!

09:28.901 --> 09:32.196
Something about righteousness and stuff!
That sure sounds like something I'd say!

09:32.280 --> 09:33.739
Huh?

09:35.032 --> 09:38.953
This is embarrassing.
How long do they plan on using this photo?

09:39.036 --> 09:42.456
Mr. Ishikawa, it's been quite a while
since you joined, right?

09:42.540 --> 09:45.501
You got it, that's the Perennial
Independent Ranger for you!

09:45.585 --> 09:48.462
In short, I'm just an old man
who doesn't know when to give up.

09:48.546 --> 09:49.964
Sure…

09:50.047 --> 09:51.465
Come on, Sakurama!

09:51.549 --> 09:55.970
How about it tonight, together?
Let's work our muscles to the core!

09:59.056 --> 10:00.474
I'm afraid I have to refuse.

10:00.558 --> 10:02.435
Too bad!
You can join me instead, Ishikawa!

10:02.518 --> 10:04.478
No, thanks, I…

10:06.063 --> 10:07.231
Excuse me…

10:07.315 --> 10:08.649
Whoa!

10:11.402 --> 10:13.195
Don't talk to me as you please.

10:20.119 --> 10:22.496
<i>The hell's wrong with him?
That was close.</i>

10:22.580 --> 10:24.457
-Hey, you should know.
-Uh?

10:24.540 --> 10:27.501
It's dangerous for you
to go near him now, Sakurama.

10:32.006 --> 10:33.591
Move it!

10:35.176 --> 10:36.761
Damn it, Sakurama.

10:36.844 --> 10:39.847
Don't get all cocky
just because you defeated a monster!

10:41.432 --> 10:42.892
Here.

10:43.434 --> 10:48.147
Besides, even I can take down
a mere Fighter!

10:50.524 --> 10:53.027
Listen. If you've learned your lesson,

10:53.110 --> 10:57.615
then stop spouting nonsense about
talking things out with monsters again!

10:59.950 --> 11:03.579
Sooner or later,
you'll have to meet my fellow trainees.

11:03.663 --> 11:05.873
They're all nice people.

11:06.457 --> 11:08.459
<i>I feel like
I now understand Sakurama better</i>

11:08.542 --> 11:10.836
<i>thanks to how they see him.</i>

11:12.463 --> 11:15.466
<i>My targets are only the Dragon Keepers.</i>

11:15.549 --> 11:18.302
<i>I don't have the time
to be dealing with small fries.</i>

11:19.095 --> 11:22.848
<i>But I don't want to create
any unnecessary trouble.</i>

11:22.932 --> 11:25.393
<i>I'll fool all of them.</i>

11:25.476 --> 11:26.519
-Hibiki.
-Huh?

11:29.689 --> 11:31.524
-What?
-It's been a while.

11:32.608 --> 11:34.735
<i>Huh? Who's this?</i>

11:35.986 --> 11:37.780
<i>Wait, don't tell me…</i>

11:38.364 --> 11:39.782
Big Sister?

11:39.865 --> 11:41.617
I hope you've been well.

11:43.369 --> 11:47.790
Oh… Yeah, I've been good. Uh…

11:47.873 --> 11:49.041
"Uh"?

11:49.125 --> 11:51.669
I have an early day tomorrow,
so please excuse me!

11:55.381 --> 11:58.300
<i>You should've told me
that your sister's part of the Rangers!</i>

11:58.384 --> 11:59.593
<i>Sakurama, you idiot!</i>

11:59.677 --> 12:02.555
Damn it, shut up! I'm trying to think!

12:02.638 --> 12:05.558
Never mind,
I should just go in and think instead.

12:05.641 --> 12:08.436
I don't need any more trouble now!

12:10.146 --> 12:11.397
Oh…

12:14.150 --> 12:16.819
Something's inside!

12:21.699 --> 12:25.411
Huh? It's just you, Hibiki.

12:25.494 --> 12:27.413
Wait… That arm!

12:30.499 --> 12:32.418
A-A Fighter…

12:32.501 --> 12:35.671
Hibiki, you'd better let me out now.

12:35.755 --> 12:37.715
It's tiring to disguise
as a surface-dweller.

12:39.049 --> 12:41.927
What's wrong, Hibiki?
Are you not alone?

12:44.513 --> 12:47.808
It goes without saying that I'll kill
those detestable Dragon Keepers

12:47.892 --> 12:50.186
and all of the surface-dwellers,

12:50.770 --> 12:53.189
but I'll make a special exception
and allow you to live.

13:00.529 --> 13:02.531
-Just keep quiet, I'm begging you!
-Mm.

13:02.615 --> 13:03.616
What's wrong?

13:03.699 --> 13:06.952
Oh… I'm cleaning up now, so please wait!

13:07.036 --> 13:11.332
What's with you all of a sudden?
Is this who you really are?

13:11.415 --> 13:13.459
You shouldn't force people
against their will…

13:13.542 --> 13:15.461
What?

13:15.544 --> 13:17.296
I'm a monster.

13:17.379 --> 13:19.215
I'm sorry for keeping quiet about it,

13:19.298 --> 13:21.467
but I'm sure
you must've had an inkling by now.

13:22.760 --> 13:26.472
<i>Just what is
her relationship with Sakurama?</i>

13:26.555 --> 13:29.475
Hey. I'm not Hibiki Sakurama.

13:34.063 --> 13:35.898
I'm a Fighter, just like you.

13:38.067 --> 13:39.318
It's a long story,

13:39.401 --> 13:41.987
but I'm currently infiltrating the Rangers
in this appearance.

13:43.572 --> 13:44.573
I apologize.

13:44.657 --> 13:46.492
It didn't occur to me
that there could still be

13:46.575 --> 13:48.285
some of our comrades on the surface.

13:48.369 --> 13:51.956
I've been searching for a way
to leave this place for a long time.

13:52.039 --> 13:55.209
I see. So help has finally arrived!

13:55.292 --> 13:56.669
<i>Help?</i>

13:56.752 --> 13:58.712
<i>What is she talking about?</i>

13:58.796 --> 14:01.215
Hibiki. Can I come in?

14:01.298 --> 14:03.217
It's reassuring to have a comrade around.

14:03.300 --> 14:06.470
We're two against one.
Let's deal with the Rangers one by one.

14:06.554 --> 14:08.430
<i>Is she stupid?</i>

14:08.514 --> 14:10.349
<i>There's no way we can do that!</i>

14:12.810 --> 14:15.563
No. This isn't the right time.

14:15.646 --> 14:18.107
Stay hidden until I give you a signal.

14:18.190 --> 14:21.318
Very well, comrade.
I shall heed your advice.

14:22.194 --> 14:25.614
Come in. Make yourself at home.

14:25.698 --> 14:27.616
It's finally the final exam.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.034
Huh? Yeah…

14:29.118 --> 14:32.371
Have you gotten a feel for real battles
through the simulated fights?

14:32.454 --> 14:34.456
<i>But they're just lowly Fighters,</i>

14:34.540 --> 14:36.125
<i>so they should be no problem.</i>

14:37.751 --> 14:40.629
S-Sorry, the pipes
have been acting up lately.

14:40.713 --> 14:42.381
What are those, Big Sister?

14:42.464 --> 14:44.925
Apples. You like them, don't you?

14:45.968 --> 14:47.845
Y-Yeah, I sure do.

14:47.928 --> 14:50.014
Oh, but I don't have a knife.

14:50.097 --> 14:52.182
There's one at the canteen,
so let's go there together.

14:52.266 --> 14:56.395
In that case, I'll go borrow one.
I want to speak with you alone, Hibiki.

14:56.478 --> 14:57.938
I-Is that so…

14:59.481 --> 15:01.942
Have a… safe trip…

15:02.526 --> 15:03.652
Hey!

15:04.236 --> 15:07.031
When do we attack?
I've been waiting for your signal.

15:07.114 --> 15:10.284
Don't rush.
You need proper timing for these things.

15:10.367 --> 15:12.036
Just eat this and wait.

15:12.620 --> 15:14.830
I don't understand the complicated stuff,

15:14.914 --> 15:16.749
but just know that I'm not patient.

15:20.085 --> 15:22.922
Oh my, it's bruised.

15:23.005 --> 15:26.800
-Actually, I think one disappeared--
-I-I can't wait to eat them!

15:26.884 --> 15:30.054
Just wait. You really like them, huh?

15:31.639 --> 15:34.224
Mom used to peel them for you, didn't she?

15:35.142 --> 15:36.810
Y-Yeah, you're right.

15:36.894 --> 15:40.064
Even I can do something this simple.

15:47.404 --> 15:49.323
-Goodness.
-I-I'll take it.

15:50.407 --> 15:52.159
What's going on? Is this an ambush?

15:52.242 --> 15:53.410
It grazed me slightly.

15:53.494 --> 15:54.578
Sorry.

15:57.665 --> 15:59.291
It's surprisingly difficult.

16:00.042 --> 16:02.628
By the way,
have you thought about what I told you?

16:02.711 --> 16:04.088
What you told me?

16:04.171 --> 16:07.591
I've been messaging you about it
since this morning.

16:07.675 --> 16:11.345
Oh, my device broke
and is currently being repaired.

16:11.428 --> 16:14.765
I see. Then I definitely made
the right choice coming here to meet you.

16:14.848 --> 16:17.351
There's only one thing
I wanted to tell you.

16:17.434 --> 16:19.353
Quit the Rangers.

16:20.437 --> 16:22.356
Huh? What do you mean…

16:22.439 --> 16:24.692
This place isn't suitable
for a pacifist like you.

16:24.775 --> 16:27.695
You should live peacefully
in a world far removed from battles.

16:27.778 --> 16:30.614
Peacefully? Huh?

16:30.698 --> 16:32.408
<i>Hey! You've got the wrong idea!</i>

16:32.491 --> 16:34.243
<i>She's the one who brought it up!</i>

16:34.326 --> 16:36.078
<i>Is there…</i>

16:36.161 --> 16:37.746
<i>really no choice but to do it?</i>

16:37.830 --> 16:39.456
Big Sister, your phone!

16:39.540 --> 16:40.541
Right.

16:41.208 --> 16:42.751
Pardon me for a moment.

16:48.799 --> 16:51.552
How long do you plan
on making nice with her?

16:51.635 --> 16:55.139
You… Are you really a Fighter?

16:55.222 --> 16:58.017
There's no point if we don't fight.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.935
Use your brain for a moment.

17:00.019 --> 17:02.771
I just came to the surface and don't know
how things work around here.

17:02.855 --> 17:04.273
"Just came"?

17:04.940 --> 17:07.109
You… Are you a Remnant?

17:11.280 --> 17:13.866
What are you doing? Aren't we comrades?

17:13.949 --> 17:16.035
"Comrades"?
How dare you say that!

17:16.118 --> 17:20.330
Please, just be quiet!
This isn't the time to be fighting!

17:20.414 --> 17:23.083
I won't.
Fighting is the only thing I know.

17:23.167 --> 17:25.711
That's what a Fighter does. And that's…

17:28.672 --> 17:30.174
That's what I'm proud of.

17:32.551 --> 17:35.304
Now I understand why you refuse to fight.

17:36.513 --> 17:41.518
<i>It's the same as 13 years ago.
You guys chose not to fight.</i>

17:41.602 --> 17:44.938
We fought against the Dragon Keepers
to the very end,

17:45.022 --> 17:47.858
and now I'm the only one left.

17:47.941 --> 17:51.862
Loser. You're gonna spread your cowardice
to me if we stay together.

17:51.945 --> 17:55.115
<i>This twerp.
I let her talk, and look what happens.</i>

17:55.199 --> 18:00.662
<i>You have no idea what I endured
while staying at that crappy place…</i>

18:01.246 --> 18:02.664
I'm sorry.
What was I thinking?

18:02.748 --> 18:06.668
You're right,
that's not how a Fighter should act.

18:07.252 --> 18:08.670
Let's go on a rampage.

18:08.754 --> 18:10.672
You learn pretty fast.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.007
But you know,

18:12.091 --> 18:14.426
it'll be dangerous
if you go out with that appearance.

18:14.510 --> 18:16.804
I'm bad at disguising
as a surface-dweller.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.430
I take a long time.

18:18.514 --> 18:20.390
Okay! I'll wait for you.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.063
<i>Found it.</i>

18:27.397 --> 18:28.565
<i>This will do.</i>

18:30.442 --> 18:32.444
All right. Let's massacre them.

18:36.782 --> 18:38.659
<i>Just stay still inside!</i>

18:38.742 --> 18:40.953
<i>You… traitor!</i>

18:41.036 --> 18:43.455
Phew… Not good!

18:47.668 --> 18:49.336
What's wrong with that door?

18:49.419 --> 18:52.339
I probably stuffed too much in there.

18:53.674 --> 18:56.510
Let's leave this place
and live together again like we used to.

18:56.593 --> 18:59.847
Staying with the Rangers
only puts you in danger.

18:59.930 --> 19:02.307
You'll be safe if you're with me.

19:02.391 --> 19:04.476
I don't want to feel scared anymore.

19:04.560 --> 19:06.103
You feel the same way, don't you?

19:08.272 --> 19:10.357
I came here to fight.

19:10.858 --> 19:12.860
You just don't listen, do you?

19:12.943 --> 19:16.363
I'm saying
that I'll do everything for you.

19:16.446 --> 19:18.699
I didn't want to tell you this,

19:18.782 --> 19:22.369
but the Ranger Force isn't as righteous
as you imagined it would be.

19:22.452 --> 19:25.205
If you truly wish for a righteous world,

19:25.289 --> 19:27.457
you shouldn't choose
the same path as mine.

19:31.712 --> 19:33.630
I don't wanna run anymore.

19:39.219 --> 19:43.056
Even if the Rangers aren't righteous,
I can't just turn a blind eye to it.

19:43.140 --> 19:45.142
<i>I'm sure this is what he'd do.</i>

19:48.437 --> 19:51.023
I came here to fight.

19:55.736 --> 19:59.907
Even if that means
having to fight me at the end?

20:04.161 --> 20:08.999
How was your reunion
with your younger brother, Pink Keeper?

20:09.082 --> 20:10.834
He's grown so big.

20:10.918 --> 20:12.169
That is fortunate.

20:12.252 --> 20:15.422
Even a boy can look like
a different person in three days.

20:15.505 --> 20:18.759
I look forward to meeting him
during the final exam…

20:18.842 --> 20:20.594
-Oh?
-Hmm?

20:29.061 --> 20:33.899
I regret
letting you guys fight for us that day.

20:33.982 --> 20:37.236
I've been their slave the entire time.

20:37.319 --> 20:42.991
That's why I'll take back our dignity.
I'll win this fight.

20:43.075 --> 20:46.495
I don't intend on forgiving you.
Just do whatever you want.

20:46.578 --> 20:47.913
I see.

20:47.996 --> 20:49.623
Just tell me one thing.

20:49.706 --> 20:50.707
Huh?

20:50.791 --> 20:52.251
Is Hibiki dead?

20:53.835 --> 20:56.755
That moron won't die so easily.

20:58.006 --> 20:59.841
I guess you're right.

21:02.594 --> 21:03.762
<i>Please stop!</i>

21:03.845 --> 21:06.014
-Why not?
-Let's just have a drink or two together!

21:06.098 --> 21:08.767
-Please don't touch me!
-"Don't touch," that's music to my ears!

21:08.850 --> 21:10.519
-Stop that right now.
-Huh?

21:12.604 --> 21:14.773
D-Dragon Keeper?

21:14.856 --> 21:18.026
Damn it! Why's one of the top members
of the Rangers here?

21:18.110 --> 21:21.154
Don't be scared, guys! That's Pink!

21:21.238 --> 21:24.658
That woman's just the pretty face
for the Dragon Keepers…

21:39.256 --> 21:42.175
Hibiki… you've really grown.

21:42.759 --> 21:44.344
…came here to fight.

21:45.012 --> 21:47.806
To think I'd see
that rebellious look in your eyes…

21:47.889 --> 21:50.392
Thinking about it makes me all excited!

21:50.475 --> 21:52.185
Your big sister's so happy!

21:52.269 --> 21:56.231
<i>I guess even girls are just
as likely to surprise you as boys do.</i>

21:57.024 --> 22:00.277
Oh, Hibiki!

23:32.494 --> 23:36.123
Nine is divisible by three,
but ten is not divisible by three.

23:36.206 --> 23:37.874
What are you on about? Oh, is that it?

23:37.958 --> 23:40.252
I'm sure of it!
You're saying something deep, right?

23:40.335 --> 23:43.088
Next episode, "1 Plus 2 Equals… Threat!"

23:43.171 --> 23:45.173
-That's no fun at all.
-Why'd you add without dividing?

23:45.257 --> 23:46.925
-Stupid!
-What a mess.

23:47.008 --> 23:48.009
Translated by Qianni Lu
